# GitHub Personal Access Token with the `models:read` permission.
# This powers the AI chatbot via GitHub Models (included in your Copilot subscription).
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY WARNING
# Vite embeds VITE_* variables into the compiled client-side bundle, so this
# token will be visible to anyone who inspects the page source.
# To limit the blast radius if the token is discovered:
#   • Use a Fine-grained token with ONLY the "models:read" permission
#     (it cannot touch your repositories or any other resource).
#   • For a production site, consider moving the API call to a serverless
#     function / backend proxy so the token never reaches the browser.
#
# How to get a minimal-scope token:
#   1. Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta
#   2. Click "Generate new token (fine-grained)"
#   3. Under "Permissions" → "Account permissions" → set "Models" to "Read-only"
#   4. Generate and copy the token
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your token — NEVER commit the .env file.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token_here
